i.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Test project: [godot-demo-projects/.../window_management](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/window_management)\r\n\r\n`DisplayServer.has_feature(DisplayServer.FEATURE_WINDOW_TRANSPARENCY)`\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/de376274041cb30ad71fd3bd8f7ec674c67187d6/platform/android/display_server_android.cpp#L79\r\n\r\nCan we activate that now too? Or evaluate `android:windowIsTranslucent` there?\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106709#pullrequestreview-2876688542","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106709","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106709#pullrequestreview-2876688542"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106709"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-28T23:32:17Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2876734581,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6rd3x1","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Test project: [godot-demo-projects/.../window_management](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/window_management)\r\n\r\n`display/window/size/transparent = true` and disabled `DisplayServer.has_feature` check:\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _on_transparent_check_button_toggled(button_pressed: bool) -> void:\r\n\t#if not DisplayServer.has_feature(DisplayServer.FEATURE_WINDOW_TRANSPARENCY):\r\n\t#\tOS.alert(\"Window transparency is not supported by the current display server (%s).\" % DisplayServer.get_name())\r\n\t#\treturn\r\n\tget_viewport().transparent_bg = button_pressed\r\n\tDisplayServer.window_set_flag(DisplayServer.WINDOW_FLAG_TRANSPARENT, button_pressed)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn Android 13, Samsung Tab S7 (Adreno 650).\r\n\r\n<details><summary>OpenGL</summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/87341d7b-d7f2-4011-842c-05f888482115\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Vulkan (Mobile)</summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc3a4b88-3a96-425a-bf55-f8775f54019d\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n<details><summary>on MacOS, Metal (Mobile) for comparison</summary>\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f1d1a4c-830d-44aa-844f-06bbf50b65c9\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n----------\r\n\r\nAt first glance OpenGL Renderer works correctly / as it should.\r\nBut after switching back and forth for the second time, the 3D scene is no longer rendered. \r\nBut these are other issues that have nothing to do with this PR. (i think)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0cb50a44-82f8-4a7f-967c-82e2afbd9699)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106709#pullrequestreview-2876734581","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106709","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106709#pullrequestreview-2876734581"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106709"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-29T00:16:59Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2876755120,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6rd8yw","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Test project: [godot-demo-projects/.../window_management](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/window_management)\r\n\r\nIn the test project, `display/window/size/transparent` isn't enabled, so I tried without it and didn't encounter any problems. Or is there anything wrong with that?  \r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\n_removed `size/transparent` from `export_plugin.cpp`_\r\n```cpp\r\nbool EditorExportPlatformAndroid::_should_be_transparent(const Ref<EditorExportPreset> &p_preset) const {\r\n\treturn (bool)get_project_setting(p_preset, \"display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed\");\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n _and  `Godot.kt`_\r\n\r\n```kotlin\r\n// Check whether the render view should be made transparent\r\nval shouldBeTransparent = java.lang.Boolean.parseBoolean(GodotLib.getGlobal(\"display/window/per_pixel_transparency/allowed\"))\r\n\r\n```\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106709#pullrequestreview-2876755120","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106709","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106709#pullrequestreview-2876755120"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106709"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-29T00:43:02Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2878619955,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6rlEEz","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Test project: [godot-demo-projects/.../window_management](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/misc/window_management)\r\n\r\nTried again on the Samsung Tab S7 and the Pixel 4a. It looks fine during startup/initialization. \r\n\r\n_The Pixel 4a OpenGLES has other rendering issues; the 2D scene (UI) fades out after switching bac